<description>&lt;p&gt;Syria is now providing military advice and training to Saudi Arabia against Houthi attacks and has signed a defence cooperation deal that includes $403 million in loans. Israeli forces have intensified cross-border actions, reporting over 60 violations in Syria since November 1 and shelling sites in Quneitra as well as striking targets in Syria and Lebanon. Syrian authorities condemned attacks on security personnel in Amman and on Egyptian border guards, and a 55‑year-old man was killed by an unexploded ordnance explosion in Hama. The conflict caused 2,732 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMixgFBVV95cUxObFFuV2xuOUtpNDJEVlB0Q0NMYV9BQkNZTzkzRkNVWHBrVGI2TC0xeUk0LTVzdWJrclByYzR3OS1PV2VJaExTT0hud2hzSENNUnlZb0J5cE5yclAtcmljYnlRcFFTOXRuOFVYbUlnbmh3cU5qQTNQSWJ3SEJ1UENMTWFUOXVBZ2xVckpNWjcwOG5meGVBWFBZRlRyZ1Q4ZkNweDlsREhMRWFwX0NrSDctbVoyZDhfdUdzOFAyVmFReUFDNkVBcmc?oc=5&quot;&gt;Reuters&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://www.aljazeera.com/news/2026/11/6/turkiyes-parliament-ratifies-mecca-defence-agreement&quot;&gt;aljazeera.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Al Jazeera&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiwgFBVV95cUxQcWNRLVVDS1dQanI1RFFKSWR5Tmt1c2VfNkhWLW1ROFNLc0tGblRHOVFXUGNPUUZ1dE1Dbm5pc3NOdjRMNFExQm1oUmFGbTkyUWJKMXNIZVk4TTduaU1uU2tUUEtPOEszeUlJMDhYdG1tOXZLMy1IZXl5Y185TUt0TGk0LXRXLTBZMVR5eEFtVjJOa2xZd0lCQXlpLUlXRnRZbVZLRGJ2RVhEMzk4MUlqQ3NvYW9Rdmhwam93a0Z6bEZvdw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Jordan News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiqwFBVV95cUxORm9PNEFpcDBVRnF1SmVLdHpibHlvX1Qtc3Zma1ZxYUxvTGkxcFBvLU9PT01xTDV1a09WelFuY1o1WURuU1E1cmptcy03LWxsem55aFV5M3VxbFRBUHhMLVlWTkg0RmF4TzVfbVgzZ0x2UUVV